  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「やっほやっほ。転校生、今日も一日お疲れさんだったね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「地下トンネルで何かあったんだって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あんたはほんと飽きもせず、よくも毎回ドタバタ騒ぎしてるよね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あたし、よく校内でデッサンしてるんだけど。あんたの周辺はやけに賑やかだから、描くの大変だよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「そのぶんみんな良い表情してるから、いろいろ捗っちゃうけどね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「でぇへへ♪　今日はあたしらで転校生を独占しちゃったから、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「体調崩して家で寝てるなっつんが羨ましがっちゃうかも？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「……聞いてるよ、なっつんから。最近、ちょっと悩んでるんだって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あっ、なっつんを責めないでね。あの子は、ひとの悩みをほいほい言いふらすようなやつじゃないから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「むしろ自分も抱えこんじゃって、当人以上にどっぷり悩んじゃうの～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あんまりにも最近、なっつんの表情が暗いからさ。心配して、すみれと一緒に無理やり聞きだしたんだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「絵筆で、足の裏を『こちょこちょ』したりね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「それでも、肝心なことは教えてくんなかったけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「何を悩んでんの、転校生。言ってみ、誰かに喋るだけで楽になるかもしれないよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「笑顔がいちばん、描いてて楽しいんだよね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ふぅん。生徒会長に、そんなこと言われたんだ。自分のしたいことをしろ、青春を楽しめって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「でも、どうしたらいいかわからないって……？　なっつんもそうだけど、あんたも受動的だしね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「『みんなのため』にはどれだけ一生懸命になれても、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「『自分のため』になると何をどうしたらいいかわかんない～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「なぁんだ、そんなことで悩んでたの？　なんて言わないよ、悩みはひとそれぞれだし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「どんな悩みも、地球より重いしね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「いいじゃん、たくさん悩めば。あたしみたいなお気楽なやつでもさ～、たまに悩んだりするしさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「今朝、学校にきてさ……。真っ白な雪景色を見て、あたしはちょっと途方に暮れちゃったんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「世界っていう画用紙、あたしの絵の具で埋め尽くすには広すぎるってね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「それを実感しちゃってさ……。でも我慢できなくて、ペンキをばらまいたりしたけどね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ほとんど何も変わらなかったよ、風が吹けばまた雪でぜんぶ真っ白に戻っちゃう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「悔しかったし、焦ったよ。あたしの人生ぜんぶ使っても、あたしの描きたいものはぜんぶ描けやしないの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「この世界に、あたしは、ほんのちいさな絵の具の跡も残せない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「そう思って、怖くなってさ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「言ってる意味、わかる？　わかんなくてもいいよ、もう実際どうでもよくなったし～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "set_still_image",
    "id": "card/evolved/1086"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「見える、この景色？　みんなが楽しんで雪像とかいろいろ、つくって……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「グラウンドを埋め尽くしちゃった、でぇへへ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「真っ白なだけだった景色に、あたしの見たことないものが広がってる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「色とりどりの、笑顔と、夢と希望と、幸せに充ち満ちてる！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「すっごいよ、芸術的感動♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_still_image"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あんたがつくったんだよ、転校生。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「もちろん、あんただけが絵筆をとったわけじゃない。個人では、こんな作品はつくれない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「独りぼっちでは、どんな天才にだって無理だね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「どんな偉大な芸術家にだって、あたしにだって、こんな景色はつくれなかった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あれっ、褒めてるんだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「もっと嬉しそうにしなよ、あたしがひとを褒めることなんて滅多にないんだぞ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あんたはけっこう、すごいやつなのかもね……転校生♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「この冴木ももが保証するよ。この景色は、これまであたしが見てきたもののなかでも上等な部類の……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ううん、最高傑作だっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「いつまで悩んでても、それはあんたの自由だけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「こんな傑作をつくったあんたが、暗い顔してるなら、あたし腹立つから絵筆でぶん殴ってやる♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「そんだけ。そこに立ってられると作業の邪魔だからどいてくんない、さっきから遠見くんも呼んでるよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
